### MIO Games — runnable requests for the JetBrains HTTP Client (WebStorm / IntelliJ).
### Start the stack first: docker compose up --build. Run top to bottom: later requests reuse earlier responses.

@mio = http://localhost:3100
@casino = http://localhost:4100
@player = http-demo-player

### 1. Casino A sends a signed deposit webhook to MIO (via the casino simulator)
POST {{casino}}/__simulate/casino-a/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{player}}", "amount": "25.00" }

### 2. Casino A issues a player session token
POST {{casino}}/__simulate/casino-a/player-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{player}}" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Available spins
GET {{mio}}/v1/me/spins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("spinId", response.body.available[0].spinId); %}

### 4. Spin the wheel (repeat it: the outcome does not change)
POST {{mio}}/v1/me/spins/{{spinId}}/play
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Wallet
GET {{mio}}/v1/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Bonus Store
GET {{mio}}/v1/store/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("itemId", response.body.items[0].itemId); %}

### 7. Redeem (needs 20 coins: repeat steps 1, 3 and 4 if the spin paid less)
POST {{mio}}/v1/me/redemptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-order-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": "{{itemId}}" }

> {% client.global.set("redemptionId", response.body.redemptionId); %}

### 8. Redemption status and history
GET {{mio}}/v1/me/redemptions/{{redemptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Raw webhook with a forged signature → 401
POST {{mio}}/v1/integrations/casino-a/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Timestamp: 1795170000
X-Signature: sha256=forged

{ "event_id": "forged-1", "event_type": "deposit", "player_id": "{{player}}", "amount_cents": 999999, "currency": "EUR", "status": "SUCCESS" }

### Make Casino A lose its next answer (MIO times out, retries with the same reference)
POST {{casino}}/__control/platform-a/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "modes": ["lost-response"] }

### What Casino A has actually granted
GET {{casino}}/__control/platform-a/grants

### Admin (Casino A): reward table versions
GET {{mio}}/v1/admin/reward-tables
X-Admin-Key: dev-casino-a-admin-key

### Admin (Casino A): publish a new reward table version
POST {{mio}}/v1/admin/reward-tables
X-Admin-Key: dev-casino-a-admin-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "segments": [
    { "key": "coins-10", "label": "10 coins", "coins": 10, "weight": 60 },
    { "key": "coins-50", "label": "50 coins", "coins": 50, "weight": 35 },
    { "key": "coins-500", "label": "500 coins", "coins": 500, "weight": 5 }
  ]
}

### Admin (Casino A): redemptions awaiting a decision
GET {{mio}}/v1/admin/redemptions?status=MANUAL_REVIEW
X-Admin-Key: dev-casino-a-admin-key
